{
  "name": "WhatsApp AI agent that answers customers and hands over to your team",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp AI agent\n\nAn AI agent answers every WhatsApp message your number receives, in the same conversation. It remembers the chat, and when a customer needs a person it passes the conversation to your team in the Cosend inbox.\n\n### Set it up\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-cosend** (Settings > Community nodes).\n2. Open **When a WhatsApp message arrives** and add a **Cosend API** credential with your API key (Cosend dashboard > Settings > Developer > API keys). Pick the same credential on the other Cosend nodes.\n3. Open **OpenAI Chat Model** and add your OpenAI credential, or swap in any chat model you like.\n4. Open **AI Agent** and write about your business in the system message: what you sell, your hours, your tone.\n5. Turn the workflow on and send a message to your business number.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e01",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Passing to a person\n**Pass to my team** is the Cosend node, working as a tool for the agent. The agent calls it when a customer asks for a person, and the conversation waits in your Cosend inbox for your team. Edit its description to change when the agent uses it.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e02",
      "name": "Tool use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Memory\nEach WhatsApp conversation keeps its own memory, so the agent follows the chat and two customers never share one.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e03",
      "name": "Memory note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "message.received"
        ],
        "filters": {
          "messageTypes": [
            "text"
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e04",
      "name": "When a WhatsApp message arrives",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosendTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e99"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.content.body }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the friendly WhatsApp assistant for our business. Answer in the customer's language, in short messages that read well on a phone. Use plain text, without markdown.\n\nAbout the business: describe what you sell, your opening hours, your address and how to book here.\n\nWhen the customer asks for a person, wants to complain, or asks something you cannot answer from the text above, call the tool that passes the conversation to the team, then tell the customer a person will reply here soon."
        }
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e05",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        700,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e06",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e07",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Pass this WhatsApp conversation to a person on the team. Use it when the customer asks for a person, wants to complain, or asks something you cannot answer.",
        "resource": "conversation",
        "operation": "setControl",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "control": "pending_human",
        "controlOptions": {
          "reason": "={{ $fromAI('reason', 'Why the customer needs a person, in one short sentence', 'string') }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e08",
      "name": "Pass to my team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosendTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "conversation",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('When a WhatsApp message arrives').item.json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d6e09",
      "name": "Reply on WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "conversation",
        "operation": "get",
        "conversationId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.conversation_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        }
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c1",
      "name": "Who is answering",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cosend.cosend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.control }}",
              "rightValue": "bot",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c2",
      "name": "No person has taken over",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Your team comes first\nThe workflow answers only while no person has taken over the chat. When it passes a chat to your team, when someone picks a chat up in the Cosend inbox, or when you reply from the WhatsApp Business app, the workflow stays quiet for that chat.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c4d8e2f1-6a7b-4c8d-9e0f-2a3b4c5d60c4",
      "name": "Your team comes first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
